      "text": "Date:\n\nCivilians wounded in bombardment by Syrian regime forces in western Aleppo governorate, October 28, 2022\n\nRelated News\n\nBody of man named Ibrahim al-Smadi found in E. Daraa, November 12, 2024\n\nSix civilians injured in a drone regime attack in W. Aleppo, November 13, 2024\n\nBoy killed, man injured by the explosion of a war remnant of unidentified source in E. Hama, November 10, 2024\n\nSyrian regime forces fired an anti-tank thermal missile, immediately followed by an artillery attack using multiple shells against al-Ashrafiya area in eastern Darat Ezza city in the western suburbs of Aleppo governorate on Friday October 28, 2022. The shells hit civilian vehicles in the area, wounding four civilians and heavily damaging the cars.\n\nSNHR condemns the bombardment of civilian areas by Syrian regime forces which fails to discriminate between civilian areas and military targets."
    }
